flowchart LR
  Definition[Shared Web definition] --> Compiler[Class boundary in Vite]
  Compiler --> Proxy[Browser Controller reference]
  Compiler --> Real[Server Controller implementation]
  Proxy --> Gate[Same-origin bounded POST]
  Gate --> Pipeline[Route codecs, guards and policies]
  SSR[SSR request] --> Pipeline
  Pipeline --> Real
  Request[Incoming request and read-only cookies] --> Real
  Real -- Application-selected request headers --> API[Internal API calls]
  API -- Response for application to handle --> Real
  Real -- Explicit writes --> Headers[Outgoing response headers]
  Real --> Public[Public data projection]
  Public --> Browser[Browser page data]
  Headers --> Response[Final response]
